 "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624700_1491182682100098_4328055637240389670_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jKnAWFFpybQQ7kNvwFU8WDw&_nc_oc=AdpIuix3mB6YsboQbVr3y0mX47xFUXiaqHXndgt5zt-Q2kpUAUVaS7Ja7oxTGwcO0BE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTCEA5XJCVE1WMlmVs01KP1F63TbC0gYUl5g4OwpwCaCA&oe=6AF0A4AC"}, {"file_name": "PICKABOOM Screenshot 7.png", "id": "1871460380468166", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617775_1871460383801499_4177718352564188009_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=D6PTOqPfi1QQ7kNvwF2YhTi&_nc_oc=Adqid5ULHA1055P4SFcFuB4fx5g_s1-WMjlIIy4MPF7InOpceqbRqzd6xAKnE9opqzQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT24roMDGJizL32cW4WEk-NW5-I1N2LvTKkDpLUED5lsw&oe=6AF0AD06"}, {"file_name": "PICKABOOM Screenshot 8.png", "id": "1202494335071082", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618442_1202494338404415_1314104998578942016_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OEk4FkNJ9N8Q7kNvwFs1hrb&_nc_oc=AdqML2l2lk-PFmWC0QKmhRfm4F72dXiN-s9Ye_uWVZDy9kbVQV9pVtpTRJUSZqufBqU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTvpeinWQVGtf3k28UkDkmMelKRfOKKhNsacOMoGAMpvg&oe=6AF0A608"}, {"file_name": "PICKABOOM Screenshot 9.png", "id": "1534195114587820", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617729_1534195117921153_8691084946846864449_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VOq5sPaiUmcQ7kNvwEhw0NY&_nc_oc=Adov3TlvpxFE0ukkJ8wCDGogTpfxiOkR__ZoCBENdrqQ_q6IFx-45dzfTXTH5Yd8I4A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQVJJLssb2CbklIXYgGWmsSSkrL5lXyRPCZvyd_gQU5dg&oe=6AF0A741"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Landscape 1 2560x1440 1.png", "id": "684914040932095", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618910_684914044265428_2959950593095626719_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PJS2r-TEQjQQ7kNvwE27oaR&_nc_oc=AdpFidK_hyJHZUpE0Tjdw72CAWLl9AGJxvb51zY3baXO1q-CljaAmeauzVrGA1oR5R4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ1Skwj5MZXkyPUBKnwElq-R7DfNQuUZTcpIawewigWtg&oe=6AF0A42F"}, "display_name": "PICKABOOM", "keywords": ["survival", "naturaldisasters", "funny", "horror", "adventure"], "long_description": "# **PICKABOOM**\n\n# Survive Natural Disasters. Free-to-Play. Weekly Updates. \n\nEnter the explosive world of PICKABOOM, a **multiplayer VR survival game** where every match feels like the end of the world. Team up with your squad to survive floods, quakes, and freak storms before the next cataclysm hits.\n{24914414018221905}\n{1393192055699014}\n\nVisit the **Avatar Shop**, led by VR fashion designer George Hermano, and mix survival gear with outrageous couture. Limited-time \u201cdisaster collections\u201d drop weekly so you can look iconic while the planet collapses around you.\n{698296172970507}\n{775418032145060}\n\nFace terrifyingly **unique monsters** that evolve with every environment, from crawling cave dwellers to colossal storm wraiths. No two encounters are the same.\n{1839225910314692}\n{799801039502319}\n\nWith **weekly updates**, new maps, disasters, and gear drop constantly, keeping the chaos alive. Jump into public or private lobbies, push your friends into danger, or save them just in time.\n{1287406879811240}\n\nJoin our Discord community to test new disasters, play with devs, and help shape PICKABOOM\u2019s future!\n\ud83d\udc49 https://linktr.ee/pickaboomvr\n\n**EQUIP. ADVENTURE. BOOM! PLAY PICKABOOM!** \ud83d\udca5", "short_description": "Survive Natural Disasters in VR! Free-to-Play. Weekly Updates. \n\nTeam up with your squad to survive floods, quakes, and spooky monsters before the next cataclysm hits.\n\nUse your 3D printer to craft new weapons: your own tools decide if you survive\u2026 or not!\n\nNew disasters, maps, and gear drop every week."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.pickaboomvr.com/policy-privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Unity 6.2.1f1 + MQDH", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.pickaboomvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "24853830584266018"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3261950660647824"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "3261950660647824"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1761836460, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3261950660647824"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "27137116405937413", "version": "0.9.833"}, "id": "1113043097583200", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24474398975542516", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27137116405937413"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1782387962, "id": "27233746052941114", "version": "1.0.847", "version_code": 847, "release_status": "RELEA